This project adapts the in-browser ISNet preprocess and composite from
chenjindu/browser-remove-background (Apache-2.0):

https://github.com/chenjindu/browser-remove-background/blob/main/index.html

The segmentation weights are the Apache-2.0 ISNet int8 export published at
https://huggingface.co/chenjindu/isnet-web. Those files are not stored in this
repository. They are downloaded by scripts/download-model.mjs and hosted by
the site operator on Cloudflare R2.

ONNX Runtime Web is MIT licensed and is loaded from the npm package
onnxruntime-web.
